WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:06.953
For months the Hwalbindang punished greedy officials.

2
00:00:06.954 --> 00:00:12.140
They gave grain to the people.

3
00:00:12.141 --> 00:00:16.912
News of the bandits spread far and wide.

4
00:00:16.913 --> 00:00:28.130
Soldiers were searching all over for the Hwalbindang.

5
00:00:28.131 --> 00:00:31.755
One day Gildong returned to the hideout.

6
00:00:31.756 --> 00:00:35.241
When he arrived, Mok was waiting.

7
00:00:35.242 --> 00:00:41.918
"We have a problem, boss," Mok said.

8
00:00:41.919 --> 00:00:45.588
He took Gildong to see Chibong.

9
00:00:45.589 --> 00:00:48.569
Chibong's face had bruises.

10
00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:52.332
Nabi was wrapping his arm with a bandage.

11
00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:55.922
"What happened?" Gildong asked.

12
00:00:55.923 --> 00:01:00.190
"My team got captured in Mungyeong," Chibong said.

13
00:01:00.191 --> 00:01:02.790
"I barely managed to escape.

14
00:01:02.791 --> 00:01:07.303
The rest of them are still there in jail."

15
00:01:07.304 --> 00:01:11.328
"We need to rescue our friends!" Nabi said.

16
00:01:11.329 --> 00:01:15.007
"The jail is heavily guarded," Chibong said.

17
00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:17.883
"We'll need a good plan."

18
00:01:17.884 --> 00:01:23.151
Mok looked at Gildong. "What are we going to do?"

19
00:01:23.152 --> 00:01:26.627
Gildong thought for a moment.

20
00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:34.566
"I have an idea," he said.

21
00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:38.706
He scribbled some words onto a scroll.

22
00:01:38.707 --> 00:01:41.000
Then he looked at Mok.

23
00:01:41.001 --> 00:01:46.019
"We need to find you some new clothes."

24
00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:53.513
Nabi giggled. "You look like a real noble, Uncle Mok."

25
00:01:53.514 --> 00:01:57.534
Mok was dressed like an official.

26
00:01:57.535 --> 00:02:02.266
"Are you sure this will work?" he asked Gildong.

27
00:02:02.267 --> 00:02:06.554
"Can't you use your fan power to blow down the jail?"

28
00:02:06.555 --> 00:02:09.272
Gildong shook his head.

29
00:02:09.273 --> 00:02:11.301
"That's not a good idea.

30
00:02:11.302 --> 00:02:18.423
We need to free everyone quickly and quietly."

31
00:02:18.424 --> 00:02:23.509
Gildong and Mok went to the jail in Mungyeong.

32
00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:26.259
At the gate a guard stepped out.

33
00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:29.838
"Halt! Who are you, and why are you here?"

34
00:02:29.839 --> 00:02:32.419
"The governor of Gyeongsang sent me.

35
00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:36.172
I, uh, have a message from him," Mok said.

36
00:02:36.173 --> 00:02:39.305
Gildong held up a scroll.

37
00:02:39.306 --> 00:02:41.407
The guard reached for it.

38
00:02:41.408 --> 00:02:46.232
"No! The message is for the warden," Mok said.

39
00:02:46.233 --> 00:02:52.003
The warden appeared and took the scroll from Gildong.

40
00:02:52.004 --> 00:02:56.533
The guard looked over the warden's shoulder.

41
00:02:56.534 --> 00:02:58.782
"What does it say?"

42
00:02:58.783 --> 00:03:02.705
"Read it for yourself!" the warden snapped.

43
00:03:02.706 --> 00:03:07.147
"I don't know how to read," the guard said.

44
00:03:07.148 --> 00:03:10.337
The warden sighed.

45
00:03:10.338 --> 00:03:14.636
"It says the governor orders us to release our prisoners.

46
00:03:14.637 --> 00:03:17.731
The men we captured aren't Hwalbindang men.

47
00:03:17.732 --> 00:03:20.089
They're the governor's spies."

48
00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:24.434
"Really?" the guard asked.

49
00:03:24.435 --> 00:03:28.130
The warden gave Mok a suspicious look.

50
00:03:28.131 --> 00:03:33.708
"Something doesn't seem right about this message."

51
00:03:33.709 --> 00:03:38.083
"How dare you question the governor's orders!" Mok snapped.

52
00:03:38.084 --> 00:03:40.337
"He'll be very angry if he hears—"

53
00:03:40.338 --> 00:03:45.267
"Okay, okay!" the warden said.

54
00:03:45.268 --> 00:03:49.524
Soon the warden released the prisoners.

55
00:03:49.525 --> 00:03:58.498
The Hwalbindang made their way toward the city walls.

56
00:03:58.499 --> 00:04:03.077
Gildong saw a group of men coming through the gate.

57
00:04:03.078 --> 00:04:06.838
He recognized their uniforms.

58
00:04:06.839 --> 00:04:15.922
"We've got trouble," Gildong said. "The royal police are coming!"

